@startuml state-offer
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #fafafa
  BorderColor #555555
  ArrowColor #333333
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffde7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #d0d0d0
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Offer — State Machine

[*] --> PENDING : dispatch creates offer\nfor one candidate

PENDING --> ACCEPTED : courier accepts within deadline (COU-02)
PENDING --> REFUSED : courier refuses (COU-02)
PENDING --> EXPIRED : deadline passed without answer

ACCEPTED --> [*]
REFUSED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]

PENDING : at most one PENDING offer per delivery (invariant)
PENDING : deadline stored in dispatch DB (ADR 0004)

note right of REFUSED
  On REFUSED or EXPIRED:
  dispatch removes the candidate and
  creates a new offer for the next one.
  If no candidates remain:
  alert to operator (SYS-04).
end note
@enduml
